  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, Saturday, <date when="1811-05-25">May 25, 1811</date>,<lb/>
               Will be perform'd the Musical Piece of<lb/>
               <bibl><title><hi rend="allcaps">Rosina</hi>.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Belville,</role> <hi rend="italic">(with the <hi rend="allcaps">Song</hi> of The <hi rend="allcaps">Thorn</hi>)</hi> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor><lb/>
                     (From the Theatre-Royal, Dublin;-His First Appearance in London.)</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Captain Belville,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rustic,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Irishman,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>William,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Phoebe,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dorcas,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rosina,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Peasants,</role> <actor>Mr. Hodson,</actor> <actor>Mr. Linton,</actor> <actor>Mr. Widdicombe,</actor> &amp;c.<lb/>
                     <actor>Miss De Camp,</actor> <actor>Mrs. Stokes,</actor> <actor>Mrs. Haughton,</actor> <actor>Miss Danton,</actor> <actor>Mrs. Kendall,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>  
               </castList>
               After which, will be produced, for the First Time, A Comick Piece in Two Acts, call'd<lb/>
               The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Trial by Jury.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With <hi rend="allcaps">New Scenery, Dresses</hi>, &amp;c.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>And <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added the Farce of<lb/>
               <bibl><title>High Life below Stairs.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Lovel,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Freeman,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Houghton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Philip,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Duke's Servant,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Harry's Servant,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Coachman,</role> <actor>Mr. Minton.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Tom,</role> <actor>Mr. Lewes.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Kingston,</role> <actor>Mr. Smith.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Robert,</role> <actor>Mr. Noble.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Kitty,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Cook,</role> <actor>Mrs. Stokes.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Cloe,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Houghton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Bab's Maid,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Lady Charlotte's Maid,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">In Act II.</hi><lb/>
              <hi rend="italic"> A Mock Minuet by Mr. Liston and Mrs. Gibbs.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi> at the Theatre.<lb/></ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
